                "word": "derogacja",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e81e40d-5ae4-3c01-9ee6-229a5c461b30",
                        "entry_id": "43fcd9e4-0fcc-3f65-88bc-8b813bc534a8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "pozbawienie normy prawnej jej mocy, z zastąpieniem lub bez zastąpienia jej nową"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ea6d7a3-4276-4b95-b4e3-d2be298b12fd",
                                "sense_id": "6e81e40d-5ae4-3c01-9ee6-229a5c461b30",
                                "text": "Wskazuje się, że stan wyjątkowy to przejściowa sytuacja, w której instytucje państwowe są postawione w zagrożonej pozycji, przez co czują się upoważnione do derogacji, czyli zawieszenia pewnych zasad, co wiąże się z ograniczeniem praw i wolności człowieka"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e36befbc-3b3d-3796-86cb-d50b9deb0075",
                        "entry_id": "43fcd9e4-0fcc-3f65-88bc-8b813bc534a8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "wyłączenie państwa członkowskiego Unii Europejskiej z obowiązku wypełniania części zobowiązań płynących ze stosowania prawa Unii"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "957a1d3d-8cff-4b58-8e46-936dcae57fa2",
                        "source_entry_id": "43fcd9e4-0fcc-3f65-88bc-8b813bc534a8",
                        "source_sense_id": "6e81e40d-5ae4-3c01-9ee6-229a5c461b30",
                        "target_lang_word": "derogation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "derogation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f978fad-c9bb-36ff-b062-b95766b564ff",
                                        "entry_id": "09dba9c3-8360-3caf-a953-0167755c49c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act which belittles; disparagement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdb51734-8f43-4e05-9884-d7173433cfe0",
                                                "sense_id": "4f978fad-c9bb-36ff-b062-b95766b564ff",
                                                "text": "Always have the greatest excesses and the most reprehensible practices been committed when backed up by or given the sanction of religion. But all this represents no derogation of the original phallic cult per se. It merely proves that the gods have always been what we have made them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41877bee-6a1a-3fc5-b11e-4a6587174c06",
                                        "entry_id": "09dba9c3-8360-3caf-a953-0167755c49c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of derogating; the temporary or partial nullification of a law."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04d9c666-c66a-4b4b-bc41-d9fc11a9cc9c",
                                                "sense_id": "41877bee-6a1a-3fc5-b11e-4a6587174c06",
                                                "text": "Two sets of Mk. 2 coaches hauled by Class 37s were introduced on peak Rhymney services during the summer. The coaches do not comply with the Persons with Reduced Mobility (PRM) standards and would therefore need a derogation to continue in passenger service after 31 December."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df6e7b8c-ba2a-4ee6-9d63-cf3d44f3a740",
                        "source_entry_id": "43fcd9e4-0fcc-3f65-88bc-8b813bc534a8",
                        "source_sense_id": "6e81e40d-5ae4-3c01-9ee6-229a5c461b30",
                        "target_lang_word": "derogace",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "23bafec6-94d4-48ec-b24f-ad51b77b88c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "43fcd9e4-0fcc-3f65-88bc-8b813bc534a8",
                        "source_sense_id": "6e81e40d-5ae4-3c01-9ee6-229a5c461b30",
                        "target_lang_word": "dérogation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dérogation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                        "entry_id": "ce08c081-4369-3c27-9557-1e57982c236e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de déroger à une loi, à un acte quelconque de l’autorité publique, à un traité, à un usage, à des droits, etc., ou résultat de cette action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fd991eb-58ef-415f-bc3b-b9699d80fe99",
                                                "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                                "text": "C’est une dérogation à l’usage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e9eec8d-78ca-4441-8490-df284ade93a3",
                                                "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                                "text": "Ce codicille renfermait une dérogation importante au testament."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f24492f-252a-4674-a68e-73854d5c373f",
                                                "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                                "text": "Cette clause n’emporte aucune dérogation à celle du précédent traité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a53cf081-c434-42c8-8a06-5acc0879a06c",
                                                "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                                "text": "C’est une dérogation à nos droits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a652c999-6a21-4b98-b303-34f733380b5b",
                                                "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                                "text": "LʼEsperanto suit sans dérogation aucune ce principe logique. Il emploie toujours le présent, même dans une phrase au passé, si lʼaction est présente relativement au temps en question."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6b471c2-ec30-4bc0-9a4a-9fb9e164420a",
                                                "sense_id": "59e3933c-de59-3c4b-b145-94ffa04a1411",
                                                "text": "C'était incroyable qu'elle ne comprît pas que la moindre dérogation aux usages serait leur mort."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73c8792c-78ba-3671-ab6e-0039af29a230",
                                        "entry_id": "ce08c081-4369-3c27-9557-1e57982c236e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suppression ou modification d’une loi par le parlement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12c4a64b-c37f-4e22-b543-d0598a5ec3a3",
                                                "sense_id": "73c8792c-78ba-3671-ab6e-0039af29a230",
                                                "text": "Il y a dans la nouvelle loi une dérogation à l’ancienne."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
